		<description><![CDATA[&#8220;Civilization&#8221; like any word about the birth of humanity has multiple conflicting, self referential definitions.  In light of the Eden moment aka:  &#8216;the birth of the civilization&#8217; gene it gets much easier. Civilization &#8211; Civilization is a group of one or more societies supporting specialization. Compare this with this page, with does a decent job [&#8230;]]]></description>
				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<div class="simplesocialbuttons">
<div class="simplesocialbutton ssb-button-twitter"><!-- Twitter--><a href="https://twitter.com/share" class="twitter-share-button" data-text="&#8220;civilization&#8221; redefined" data-url="http://civgene.matthewnewhall.com/archives/222" rel="nofollow"></a></div>
