		<description><![CDATA[Credit for the proto-psychopath goes to Thomas Sheridan.  I first read about it in his book &#8216;Puzzling People.&#8217;   It is an important part of the puzzle.  He mainly talks about proto-psychopaths having been so badly reprogrammed that their conscience is effectively shut off.  Their resulting behavior is indistinguishable from a psychopath.  An empath would need [&#8230;]]]></description>
				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<div class="simplesocialbuttons">
<div class="simplesocialbutton ssb-button-twitter"><!-- Twitter--><a href="https://twitter.com/share" class="twitter-share-button" data-text="Proto-psychopaths and Meta-psychopaths" data-url="http://civgene.matthewnewhall.com/archives/142" rel="nofollow"></a></div>
<div class="simplesocialbutton ssb-button-googleplus"><!-- Google Plus One--><div class="g-plusone" data-size="medium" data-href="http://civgene.matthewnewhall.com/archives/142"></div></div>
